    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27726" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Mālĭăcus
		Sĭnus</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a gulf south of Thessaly</i>, now <i>Gulf of Zeitouni</i>, <i><span class="en">Mel. 2, 3, 6</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 4, 7,
				12, § 27</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Liv. 27,
				30, 3</span></i>.— Hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Mālĭensis</span></b> ,
				e, <i>adj., Malian</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ager,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					42, 40, 6</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Mālĭus</span></b> ,
				a, um, <i>adj., Malian</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lympha,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cat.
					68, 54</span></i>
			.</div>
